OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife trust discourages
OL,4,Aforaging at reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Wildlife Trust says it
OL,7,Fis "discouraging" visitors from picking
OL,8,Fblackberries at one of its more popular
OL,9,Fnature reserves.
OL,11,FErin McDaid, from the trust, said the
OL,12,Fpopularity of the Attenborough Nature
OL,13,FReserve with visitors meant more
OL,14,Fforaging was likely to have an impact
OL,15,Fon the wildlife there, particularly
OL,16,Fafter a dry and hot summer.
OL,18,FThe trust urged visitors to "forage
OL,19,Fresponsibly" at its other nature
OL,20,Freserves and only take small amounts.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
