OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife trust discourages
OL,4,Aforaging at reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcDaid said that rangers would
OL,7,Fintervene and speak to visitors if they
OL,8,Fhad wandered off the designated paths
OL,9,For were "trampling into the brambles".
